## Corporate withdrawal team

cmu-wy-withdrawal-name-pilot = WY Corporate Pilot
cmu-wy-withdrawal-prefix-pilot = WYCP
cmu-wy-withdrawal-description-pilot = A Weyland-Yutani corporate pilot flying the company shuttle down to collect corporate staff as Weyland-Yutani withdraws from the colony.
cmu-wy-withdrawal-greeting-pilot = You are a Weyland-Yutani Corporate Pilot. The company is pulling out of this colony. Land, collect the corporate staff and their assets, and fly them out. Your security detail answers to you until you're back in orbit.
cmu-wy-withdrawal-supervisors-pilot = the senior corporate employee on site

cmu-wy-withdrawal-name-security = WY Withdrawal Security Officer
cmu-wy-withdrawal-prefix-security = Off.
cmu-wy-withdrawal-description-security = A Weyland-Yutani security officer sent down with the company shuttle to secure the withdrawal of corporate staff from the colony.
cmu-wy-withdrawal-greeting-security = You are a Weyland-Yutani security officer on the withdrawal shuttle. Secure the landing zone, escort corporate staff and assets aboard, and keep the colony from getting in the way.
cmu-wy-withdrawal-supervisors-security = the Corporate Pilot

cmu-wy-withdrawal-rules = You are part of Weyland-Yutani's withdrawal team. Your job is to get corporate staff and assets off the colony safely. Escalate only in self-defence or when the withdrawal is threatened.
